    "sections": [
      {
        "kind": "definition",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "A website custom audience is a Meta audience of people who visited your site, which you can then target with ads. It only works if the Meta pixel is tracking your visitors, and it starts filling from creation, not from past traffic.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences.website.about",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/610516375684216",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Website Custom Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              },
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.website_audience",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/1474662202748341",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a website custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "The Meta pixel records visits to your website. You build the audience from a pixel, choose which events or pages qualify, and set an audience retention period in days.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.website_audience",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/1474662202748341",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a website custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "The audience populates from the moment you create it. It will not backfill earlier visitors.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.website_audience",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/1474662202748341",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a website custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "You can combine up to five rules per audience, using include-more and exclude-people options.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.website_audience",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/1474662202748341",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a website custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "European privacy changes may affect campaigns reaching people in the European region. Audience options are also limited where the audience includes people under 18 (older in some countries).",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences.website.about",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/610516375684216",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Website Custom Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": [
              "European region",
              "audiences including under-18s"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "use_cases",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "inferred",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Use it when you have a working Meta pixel and want to reach people who have already shown interest by visiting your site, for example key product or checkout pages.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences.website.about",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/610516375684216",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Website Custom Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when your pixel is not installed, when you need to capture visitors from before the audience existed, or when you advertise to teens or in the European region, where options and reporting may be restricted.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.website_audience",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/1474662202748341",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a website custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              },
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences.website.about",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/610516375684216",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About Website Custom Audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
